# BCCS142 Revenue-Based Financing - Detailed Financial Statements
## 5-Year Financial Projections and Analysis

### Executive Summary

**Investment Structure**: Revenue-Based Financing (RBF)
**Principal Amount**: $1,500,000
**Fixed ROI**: 40% ($600,000)
**Total Repayment**: $2,100,000
**Repayment Period**: 36 months (Months 19-54)
**Monthly Payment**: $58,333
**Founder Equity**: 100% retained

