## RBF PAYMENT SCHEDULE AND COVERAGE ANALYSIS

### **Detailed Payment Schedule**

| Month | Revenue | EBITDA | Payment | Coverage Ratio | Remaining Balance |
|-------|---------|---------|---------|----------------|-------------------|
| 19 | $667K | $267K | $58.3K | 4.6x | $2,041.7K |
| 24 | $917K | $367K | $58.3K | 6.3x | $1,750K |
| 30 | $2M | $800K | $58.3K | 13.7x | $1,400K |
| 36 | $2.5M | $1M | $58.3K | 17.2x | $1,050K |
| 42 | $5M | $2M | $58.3K | 34.3x | $700K |
| 48 | $6M | $2.4M | $58.3K | 41.1x | $350K |
| 54 | $20.8M | $8.8M | $58.3K | 151x | $0 |

### **Payment Security Metrics**

**Minimum Coverage Ratios Maintained:**
- Month 19-24: 4.6x - 6.3x (Conservative)
- Month 25-36: 13.7x - 17.2x (Strong)
- Month 37-48: 34.3x - 41.1x (Excellent)
- Month 49-54: 100x+ (Minimal burden)

**Risk Mitigation Features:**
- Personal guarantee from founder
- Senior claim on all revenue streams
- 18-month grace period for revenue establishment
- Diversified customer base reducing concentration risk

